title: "Python RymdFysik Utilities (PyRFU): An Open-Source Python Package for Advanced In-Situ Space Plasma Analysis"
abstract: "pyrfu is an open-source Python package for advanced in-situ space plasma analysis, particularly of the Magnetospheric Multiscale (MMS) mission."
